# GYM PHOTOS BETA — facility photography

**Source folder (repo root):** `GYM PHOTOS BETA/`

This is the master library for all United Strength facility photos. Do **not** use Unsplash or stock placeholders when a real asset exists here. When adding or swapping site imagery, pick from this folder first.

## Current subfolders

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| *(root)* | General facility shots not yet sorted |
| `B Roll aesthitc ` | Aesthetic b-roll — atmosphere, architecture, cinematic crops (note trailing space in folder name) |
| `Equipment` | Equipment close-ups and rack/detail shots |

**More folders will be added.** When new subfolders appear, update this table with name + intended use. Do not rename source folders unless the client asks.

