## When adding photos

1. Drop new files into the appropriate `GYM PHOTOS BETA/` subfolder (or create a new subfolder and note it here).
2. Copy chosen files to `src/assets/images/gym/` with a short semantic filename (kebab-case).
3. Export from `src/assets/images/gym/index.ts` and import in components.
4. Update the wiring table above.

Coach/team headshots stay in `src/assets/images/` (separate from facility library).

## Anti-patterns

- Hardcoding Unsplash URLs for facility/space/equipment imagery
- Importing directly from `GYM PHOTOS BETA/` in components (Vite bundle path — copy to `src/assets/images/gym/` instead)
- Renaming or moving files inside `GYM PHOTOS BETA/` without updating this rule
